 "name_en": "Debt and Investment Management (1WV)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Debt and Investment Management (1WV)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiode0f4119ead64ce78c503dd9a1b70a25\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiode0f4119ead64ce78c503dd9a1b70a25__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The debt and investment management process helps you to secure short-term liquidity at the best interest rates, and manage your medium- to long-term debt and investments optimally. The functionality helps you to automate labor-intensive processes, such as confirmation of financial transactions and accounting postings, giving you more time to focus on value-added activities. You can manage operational and accounting requirements. The process includes the products fixed-interest investments and borrowing, variable-interest investments and borrowing, commercial paper purchase and issue, deposit at notice and facilities.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiode0f4119ead64ce78c503dd9a1b70a25__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create financial transactions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate confirmations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process payments</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer values to general ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Adjust interest rates</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform month-end accounting processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reclassification</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate and post realized profit and loss</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor and report on positions and financial transactions</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiode0f4119ead64ce78c503dd9a1b70a25__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Review the financial status</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate the management of investments and borrowings, including creation of the financial transaction, confirmation of contract with counterparty, payments, interest rate adjustments, and accounting</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Make better operational and strategic decisions using the comprehensive reporting and analysis tools</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve internal operational compliance</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase your focus on value-added activities instead of on manual procedures</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>债务和投资管理 (1WV)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiode0f4119ead64ce78c503dd9a1b70a25\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiode0f4119ead64ce78c503dd9a1b70a25__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">债务和投资管理流程可帮助您以最佳利率确保短期流动性，并以最佳方式管理中长期债务和投资。此功能可帮助您自动化劳动密集型流程（例如确认金融交易和会计过账），为您提供更多时间来关注增值活动。您可以管理运营和会计要求。该流程包括产品固定利息投资和借款、可变利息投资和借款、商业票据购买和发行、通知存款和授信协议。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiode0f4119ead64ce78c503dd9a1b70a25__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建金融交易</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理付款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将值传输到总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">调整利率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行月末会计流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">重新分类</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">计算并过账已实现的损益</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控并报告头寸和金融交易</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiode0f4119ead64ce78c503dd9a1b70a25__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">检查财务状况</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动管理投资和借款，包括创建金融交易、与交易对手确认合同、付款、利率调整和会计核算</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用全面的报表和分析工具，制定更明智的运营和战略决策</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高内部运营合规性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">增加您对增值活动的关注，而不是手动程序</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
